---
import { company } from '../../data/company';
---

<section class="hero-section" id="mission">
  <div class="content-column">
    <a class="announcement" href="/manifesto"
      ><span></span> Introducing Kalaris Labs <b>Read the manifesto ↗</b></a
    >
    <h1>{company.oneLiner}</h1>
    <p class="hero-lede">{company.description}</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/research"
        >Explore the research <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
      ><a class="button button-secondary" href="mailto:contact@kalarislabs.com"
        >Talk to us ↗</a
      >
    </div>

    <div
      class="system-visual"
      aria-label="A diagram showing research knowledge compounding through recursive cycles"
    >
      <div class="visual-grid"></div>
      <div class="visual-node node-a">Question</div><div
        class="visual-node node-b"
      >
        Context
      </div><div class="visual-node node-c">Experiment</div><div
        class="visual-node node-d"
      >
        Evidence
      </div><div class="visual-node node-e">Learning</div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 800 280" role="presentation"
        ><path d="M92 140 C210 24 350 38 406 128 S610 240 716 132"></path><path
          d="M92 140 C240 258 316 240 406 128 S598 20 716 132"></path></svg
      >
      <p>Every research cycle should leave the next one stronger.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="home-brief">
      <article id="what-we-do">
        <h2>Less setup. More discovery.</h2><p>
          We are building an agent-powered infrastructure layer that can learn
          from workflows, repositories, papers, and iterations while researchers
          remain in control of the work.
        </p><a href="/manifesto">Why we are building it ↗</a>
      </article>
      <article id="who-it-is-for">
        <h2>For everyone doing research.</h2><p>
          Professors, students, independent researchers, interdisciplinary
          teams, and anyone following a serious question should have access to
          operational leverage.
        </p><a href="/research">See what we are learning ↗</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
